%%{init:{"theme":"neutral"}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Lead Auditor
  participant API as NestJS API
  participant W as BullMQ Worker
  participant VLM as VLM Sidecar (vlm-py)
  participant S3 as MinIO / S3
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant L as Audit Ledger

  A->>API: POST /v1/evidence/uploads/presign
  API-->>A: Presigned S3 URL + upload_id

  A->>S3: PUT file (PDF / image / video)
  A->>API: POST /v1/evidence/uploads/finalize (upload_id)
  API->>DB: INSERT evidence_file row (pending_extraction)
  API->>W: Enqueue evidence.extract job
  API->>L: Emit evidence.uploaded (signed)
  API-->>A: evidence_id

  W->>S3: GET file bytes
  W->>VLM: gRPC ExtractClaims(bytes, schema)
  Note over VLM: Qwen2.5-VL or DeepSeek-OCR\nschema-constrained output only
  VLM-->>W: Structured claims JSON
  W->>DB: Bulk UPSERT claim rows
  W->>DB: UPDATE evidence_file (extracted)
  W->>L: Emit evidence.extracted (signed)

  A->>API: GET /v1/evidence/:id (poll or SSE)
  API-->>A: Extracted claims + confidence
  A->>API: PATCH claim (auditor_confirmed)
  API->>L: Emit claim.confirmed (signed)
